port databases/sq
type port
reason "DragonFly: vendored moby/term leaves DragonFly out of its BSD termios ioctls (dragonfly/@<line> patches)"

# dragonfly/@<line>/patch-vendor_github.com_moby_term_*: the vendored
# moby/term (v0.5.0 on 2026Q3, v0.5.2 on 2026Q4/main) treats DragonFly as
# non-BSD and wants Linux's TCGETS/TCSETS; add it to the BSD
# (TIOCGETA/TIOCSETA) build tags.
